    <span style="font-family: Comic Sans MS;"></span><span style="font-family: Comic Sans MS;"></span>
    <p><span style="font-family: Comic Sans MS;">3 février 1659, baptême de
        Charles Gourdier</span></p>
    <p style="margin-left: 40px;"><span style="font-family: Comic Sans MS;"></span><small><span
          style="font-family: Comic Sans MS;">Le troisiesme de febvrier mil six
          cents<br>
          cinquante neuf a esté baptisé un fils<br>
          nay en legitime mariage de Charles<br>
          Gourdier esc[uye]r &amp; de dam[ois]elle<span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">
            francoise de la</span><br style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">
          <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">Bonde</span> lequel a esté
          nommé Charles par<br>
          Charles du Chastel esc[uye]r s[ieu]r &amp; patron de Rampan &amp; par<br>
          francoise Le prestre parrain &amp; marraine</span></small><small><span
          style="font-family: Comic Sans MS;"></span></small></p>
    <p style="margin-left: 40px;"><small><span style="font-family: Comic Sans MS;"></span></small></p>
